        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "In swamplands, you are particularly skilled at quickly hiding behind bits of underbrush or foliage, or moving quietly through murky water. You Take Cover and then use that cover to "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "5a86b7d0-fc0e-52a6-9b0d-fb58ed15233d"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "."
